##grflangid 0x01
# English language file for Modified Intercontinental Airport NewGRF

STR_GRF_NAME                        :Intercontinental Airport Variants
STR_GRF_DESC                        :Adds a second layout to the Intercontinental Airport with shorter runways and taxi holding bays. Use the rotation arrows in the build menu to choose between Original and Modified.

STR_AIRPORT_NAME                    :Intercontinental Airport
STR_AIRPORT_ADDTEXT                 :{BLACK}Two layouts available (use arrows to switch):{}  Original — full-length runways{}  Modified — shorter runways with holding bays{}8 terminals, 2 helipads, 2 hangars.
STR_LAYOUT_ORIGINAL                 :Original
STR_LAYOUT_MODIFIED                 :Modified (short runways)
